---
// "What is The Internal Medicine Group?" — three-column mission blurb.
// Ported verbatim from tools/snapshots/meet-the-team.html (search
// "about-us-container"). Static copy, not CMS-driven — the live markup has
// no w-dyn-list here, just three hardcoded .about-us cards.
---

<div class="general-section no-margin gray-bg about-us-container">
  <div class="container doctors-section">
    <div class="text-center margin-50">
      <h4 class="section-title-top">About Us</h4>
      <h2 class="section-title">what is The Internal Medicine Group?</h2>
      <div class="section-line-animation-div">
        <div style="width:20%" class="color-line"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="w-layout-grid grid-11">
      <div class="about-us dark-color">
        <p class="paragraph white about-the-practice">
          We provide board-certified internal medicine diagnostics and consultations directly where pets and owners
          need them, through mobile services and pop-up clinics. By performing ultrasounds, fine needle aspirates,
          and consultations personally, we deliver accurate diagnoses and real-time recommendations without
          unnecessary delays or stress.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-us light-color">
        <p class="paragraph white about-the-practice">
          Specialty veterinary care should be accessible, transparent, and centered on the patient; not limited by
          hospital walls or inflated referral costs. We believe pets deserve expert-level medicine delivered with
          clarity, compassion, and integrity, even if that means referring elsewhere when it&rsquo;s truly best for
          the patient.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-us main-color">
        <p class="paragraph white about-the-practice">
          Care is personal here. The specialist who reviews your case is the same one performing the diagnostic
          study, speaking with you during the exam, and guiding next steps. This hands-on approach reduces anxiety,
          speeds decision-making, and ensures pets receive thoughtful, individualized car, not assembly-line
          diagnostics.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
